    {
      "id": 3788,
      "nameEs": "Age of Empires: Mythologies",
      "originalName": "Age of Empires: Mythologies",
      "year": 2008,
      "igdbId": 21221,
      "popularity": 29,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Age of Empires: Mythologies",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Age of Empires: Mythologies",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Inspired by the hit PC title and built on the game engine behind the critically acclaimed Age of Empires: Age of Kings, Age of Empires: Mythologies will be the ultimate portable tactical strategy game with its refined gameplay, inspired design, fantastic multiplayer, and extensive replay value.\n\nAge of Empires: Mythologies for the Nintendo DS is a compelling new turn-based strategy game that challenges players to shape the destiny of three unique cultures in a fantasy world filled with mighty heroes, legendary monsters, and powerful gods. Players will lead their Egyptian, Greek, and Norse heroes to victory by raising massive armies, waging war, exploring new frontiers, and advancing through three distinct ages that offer fantastic new units, abilities, and god powers like lighting storms, earthquakes, and devastating plagues that players can call on to smite their enemies.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Inspirado en el exitoso título para PC y construido sobre el motor de juego que impulsó la aclamada Age of Empires: Age of Kings, Age of Empires: Mythologies será el juego de estrategia táctica portátil definitivo, con su jugabilidad refinada, un diseño inspirador, un multijugador excelente y un gran valor de rejugabilidad.\n\nAge of Empires: Mythologies para Nintendo DS es un nuevo y atractivo juego de estrategia por turnos que reta a los jugadores a dar forma al destino de tres culturas únicas en un mundo de fantasía lleno de héroes poderosos, monstruos legendarios y dioses todopoderosos. Los jugadores guiarán a sus héroes egipcios, griegos y nórdicos hacia la victoria, reuniendo ejércitos masivos, librando guerras, explorando nuevas fronteras y avanzando por tres eras distintas que ofrecen nuevas unidades, habilidades y poderes divinos, como tormentas de rayos, terremotos y plagas devastadoras, a los que los jugadores pueden recurrir para castigar a sus enemigos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
